s could cause the app to fail silently. \n\nBy getting these details, the user can determine if the issue is with the environment setup, missing files, or an application error that\'s not logged. Once they have that info, they can take further steps like checking the image, adjusting configurations, or looking into the application\'s code for errors.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl exec -it profile-69cb98cb67-rtsbd -n hotel-reservation -- printenv"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8d594b15bde07ac8', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'refusal': None, 'reasoning': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 498, 'prompt_tokens': 9096, 'total_tokens': 9594, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfb0d-1ee3-7dc2-bfaf-57460184dd4b-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl exec -it profile-69cb98cb67-rtsbd -n hotel-reservation -- printenv'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-8d594b15bde07ac8', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 9096, 'output_tokens': 498, 'total_tokens': 9594}), ToolMessage(content='Command Rejected (ValueError): Interactive flag detected: -it. Such commands are not supported. Try to use the command non-interactively.', id='da0319ae-7041-4247-b3ff-35569c2af4c5', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-8d594b15bde07ac8'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='3064cea6-4c17-4ff2-84b0-4f1f813de12a'), AIMessage(content="<think>\nOkay, let's see. The user is trying to debug a Kubernetes pod that's exiting with code 2. They've already checked the logs, described the pod, and found that